+# TLS Certificate Verification in Development Builds
+
+This project has no recorded decision on TLS certificate verification in development builds. A search of the repository (README, CHANGELOG, docs, and commit history) found no policy statement on the matter; the only occurrences of certificate-verification bypass (`InsecureSkipVerify`) appear in test files to work around self-signed test certificates, which is not a recorded project decision or policy.
